    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clarke Auctioneers Ltd are delighted to bring to market Bramble Cottage, a wonderful detached family home with exceptional charm, generous accommodation and an outstanding detached garage, set on a beautiful elevated site overlooking the stunning Deputy's Pass woodland.\nThis impressive four-bedroom detached home extends to approximately 200 sq.m. (2,153 sq. ft.) and offers a rare combination of character, modern convenience and a superb countryside setting.\n\nThe property has been lovingly maintained and upgraded and is presented as a warm and welcoming family home. The accommodation centres around a fantastic open-plan kitchen, galleried living room and extensive kitchen/dining space, complemented by a country-style kitchen, separate utility room and a wonderful conservatory overlooking the mature gardens. There are four generous bedrooms, two with en-suite bathrooms, together with a separate study and recently renovated family and guest bathrooms presented to the highest standards. The layout provides excellent flexibility for family living and for those working from home.\n\nA major feature of Bramble Cottage is the substantial detached garage and ancillary building which is constructed to an exceptionally high standard. The ground floor incorporates a generous garage/workshop, while the first floor provides a space ideal for home office / playroom / studio. This additional space offers enormous flexibility and is a huge bonus and an increasingly rare feature in today's market.\n\nOutside, the property is approached through electric gates onto a gravelled driveway and enjoys beautifully mature, private gardens extending to approximately 1/3 of an acre. Established flower beds, shrubs and mature trees create a wonderfully peaceful setting a genuine oasis in the countryside. Property is serviced by a biocyle system and uses oil fired central heating. \n\nThe elevated site enjoys uninterrupted views across the Deputy's Pass valley, while the M11 motorway is approximately five minutes away, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and the surrounding area. The popular village of Glenealy is the closest centre of population, with Wicklow Town, Ashford and other surrounding towns and villages within easy reach.\n\nBramble Cottage is a truly special home that combines the peace and beauty of the Wicklow countryside with excellent accessibility and an exceptional range of accommodation. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
